{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24027","headline":"咏兴五首 小庭亦有月 · 白居易","name":"咏兴五首 小庭亦有月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小庭亦有月，小院亦有花。\n可怜好风景，不解嫌贫家。\n菱角执笙簧，谷儿抹琵琶。\n红绡信手舞，紫绡随意歌。\n邨歌与社舞，客哂主人夸。\n但问乐不乐，岂在钟鼓多。\n客告暮将归，主称日未斜。\n请客稍深酌，愿见朱颜酡。\n客知主意厚，分数随口加。\n堂上烛未秉，座中冠已峩。\n左顾短红袖，右命小青娥。\n长跪谢贵客，蓬门劳见过。\n客散有余兴，醉卧独吟哦。\n幕天而席地，谁奈刘伶何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}